    "difficulty": "hard",
    "question": {
      "en": "In a triangle ABC, if the incenter is at point I and angle ∠BAC = 70°, what is the measure of angle ∠BIC?",
      "hi": "एक त्रिभुज ABC में, यदि अंतःकेंद्र बिंदु I पर है और कोण ∠BAC = 70° है, तो कोण ∠BIC का माप क्या होगा?"
    },
    "options": [
      {
        "en": "125°",
        "hi": "125°"
      },
      {
        "en": "55°",
        "hi": "55°"
      },
      {
        "en": "110°",
        "hi": "110°"
      },
      {
        "en": "70°",
        "hi": "70°"
      }
    ],
    "answer": 0,
    "explanation": {
      "en": "Angle formed at incenter: ∠BIC = 90° + ∠A / 2 = 90° + 70/2 = 125°.",
      "hi": "अंतःकेंद्र पर बनने वाला कोण: ∠BIC = 90° + ∠A / 2 = 90° + 35° = 125°।"
    },
